OL,3,GNEWSAAnother property searched as
OL,4,Apolice look for body
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for the body of a man
OL,7,Flast seen in Leicester two years ago
OL,8,Fhave searched a property in
OL,9,FLincolnshire.
OL,11,FGary Piatek, 60, was last seen in April
OL,12,F2024, and though his body has not been
OL,13,Ffound Leicestershire Police started a
OL,14,Fmurder investigation earlier this year.
OL,16,FA force statement said they searched an
OL,17,Faddress on Holbeach Road in Spalding on
OL,18,FTuesday "as part of ongoing enquiries",
OL,19,Fbut said no arrests were made.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
